{"id":"54214c775a52cd3a","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NatOperation.md","title":"NatOperation","display":"NatOperation","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"NatOperation","parameters":["c","vs","v"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"NatOperation"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>c</span><span>vs</span><span>v</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论模型与证明。有序参数：<code>c</code>、<code>vs</code>、<code>v</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ NatOperation c vs v)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ Nat v)\n  (and\n    (exists w (exists n (and (@ Omega w) (@ SeqTo vs n w))))\n    (or\n      (exists c0\n        (exists arity\n          (exists z\n            (exists one\n              (exists x\n                (exists y\n                  (and\n                    (@ Num0 c0)\n                    (and\n                      (= c c0)\n                      (and (@ Num0 arity) (and (@ Seq vs arity) (and (@ Num0 z) (and (@ Num1 one) (@ Num0 v)))))))))))))\n      (or\n        (exists c0\n          (exists arity\n            (exists z\n              (exists one\n                (exists x\n                  (exists y\n                    (and\n                      (@ Num1 c0)\n                      (and\n                        (= c c0)\n                        (and\n                          (@ Num1 arity)\n                          (and (@ Seq vs arity) (and (@ Num0 z) (and (@ Num1 one) (and (@ App vs z x) (@ Succ x v))))))))))))))\n        (or\n          (exists c0\n            (exists arity\n              (exists z\n                (exists one\n                  (exists x\n                    (exists y\n                      (and\n                        (@ Num2 c0)\n                        (and\n                          (= c c0)\n                          (and\n                            (@ Num2 arity)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Seq vs arity)\n                            (and (@ Num0 z) (and (@ Num1 one) (and (@ App vs z x) (and (@ App vs one y) (@ Add x y v)))))))))))))))\n          (exists c0\n            (exists arity\n              (exists z\n                (exists one\n                  (exists x\n                    (exists y\n                      (and\n                        (@ Num3 c0)\n                        (and\n                          (= c c0)\n                          (and\n                            (@ Num2 arity)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Seq vs arity)\n                            (and (@ Num0 z) (and (@ Num1 one) (and (@ App vs z x) (and (@ App vs one y) (@ Mul x y v))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fe9bf6b2a1b03aa\" href=\"?note=0fe9bf6b2a1b03aa\" title=\"ZFC_Add\">Add</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"46192dc3bc57d713\" href=\"?note=46192dc3bc57d713\" title=\"ZFC_Mul\">Mul</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6abf464803506304\" href=\"?note=6abf464803506304\" title=\"ZFC_Num1\">Num1</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36fc33b3a64f5aa9\" href=\"?note=36fc33b3a64f5aa9\" title=\"ZFC_Num2\">Num2</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"328ced6f64afa4d9\" href=\"?note=328ced6f64afa4d9\" title=\"ZFC_Num3\">Num3</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"572634b8affcd095\" href=\"?note=572634b8affcd095\" title=\"ZFC_SeqTo\">SeqTo</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" href=\"?note=1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" title=\"ZFC_Succ\">Succ</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ NatOperation c vs v)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Add","status":"resolved","id":"0fe9bf6b2a1b03aa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Add|Add]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Mul|Mul]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_Num2|Num2]]；[[ZFC_Num3|Num3]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]；[[ZFC_SeqTo|SeqTo]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Add|Add]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Mul|Mul]]；[[ZF